<p>Thank you so much for your praise!! To answer your questions:</p>
<p>1. The anomaly occurs for humans of all sexes, though it does not work on animals or non-humanoid SCPs.</p>
<p>2. The anomaly itself does not occur from Lopez's mind, but rather from some feature of her chest alone. It is unknown whether this anomaly was always present within her chest but was only discovered after the Briggs incident, or whether Briggs somehow caused it to manifest - based on an interview with Lopez's parents, it is speculated that it might have first come about during puberty.</p>
<p>Anyway, I hope this clears things up!</p>

